Cost based recommender
Artin Chicken Pilaf: 
Ingredients: chicken:1, rice:1, butter:1, salt:1 
Calories: 475
Steps:
Artin rinses rice until water runs clear
Amirreza sautes chicken pieces in butter until golden
Mahdis adds rice and stirs to coat with butter
Mahdi pours in water and brings to boil
Elahe covers and cooks on low heat until rice is fluffy
Taha Scrambled Eggs: 
Ingredients: eggs:2, butter:1, salt:1, pepper:1 
Calories: 630
Steps:
Taha cracks eggs into a large bowl
Babak whisks eggs with salt and pepper until fluffy
Parisa heats butter in a non-stick pan over medium heat
Paria pours eggs into pan and stirs gently
Artin serves the creamy scrambled eggs on a warm plate
Parisa Egg Sandwich: 
Ingredients: bread:2, eggs:1, butter:1, salt:1 
Calories: 575
Steps:
Parisa toasts bread slices until crispy golden
Paria fries egg sunny-side up with a pinch of salt
Artin spreads butter on warm toast
Amirreza assembles sandwich with egg between bread
Mahdis cuts sandwich diagonally and serves
